OL,4,G2245FThe White Lady of Morecambe by
OL,5,     FJenn Ashworth
OL,6,     GOn the day before the brutal King
OL,7,     GTide, those stubbornly remaining
OL,8,     Gon the Bay prepare for what is
OL,9,     Gabout to hit them. Julie
OL,10,     GHesmondhalgh reads Jenn
OL,11,     GAshworth's eco-gothic story.
OL,12,G2300FBolton: The Happiest Town on
OL,13,     FEarth?
OL,14,     G'What is happiness?' The people
OL,15,     Gof Bolton were asked this
OL,16,     Gquestion in the 1930s as part of
OL,17,     Ga mass observation. We return to
OL,18,     GBolton to find out if they have
OL,19,     Gthe answer.
